---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Carve Model | Precision Architectural, Film & Product Models in Los Angeles"
  description="Meet Carve Model, a Los Angeles model-making studio managing architectural models, product prototypes, film miniatures and art maquettes from scope through delivery."
  canonicalPath="/about-carve-model"
  ogTitle="About Carve Model | Los Angeles Model-Making Studio"
  ogDescription="We don't just make models — we help clients visualize, refine, and communicate their vision with confidence."
  active="about"
  imageSlot={true}
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<style>
.page-hero{padding-top:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem);padding-bottom:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem);}
.page-hero h1{margin-top:1.4rem;}.page-hero p{margin-top:1.4rem;}
.page-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
.page-hero__inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,3rem);align-items:center;}
@media(max-width:900px){.page-hero__inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.page-hero__visual{order:-1;max-width:440px;}}
.page-hero__visual{position:relative;}
.page-hero__visual .hero-photo{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:var(--r-sm);object-fit:cover;object-position:50% center;}
.page-hero__visual .corner{position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;border:1px solid var(--cm-silver);opacity:0.5;z-index:3;}
.page-hero__visual .corner.tl{top:-1px;left:-1px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0;}
.page-hero__visual .corner.br{bottom:-1px;right:-1px;border-left:0;border-top:0;}
.hero__spec{position:absolute;right:-12px;bottom:24px;z-index:4;background:var(--cm-ink-800);border:1px solid var(--cm-border-strong);padding:0.9rem 1.1rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);}
.hero__spec .tick{display:block;}
.hero__spec strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--w-bold);color:var(--cm-text-strong);font-size:1.1rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
.hero__cta{display:flex;gap:0.9rem;flex-wrap:nowrap;margin-top:1.8rem;}
@media(max-width:560px){.hero__cta{flex-wrap:wrap;}}
.hero__cta .btn--primary,.hero__cta .btn--ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--cm-text-strong);border:1px solid var(--cm-border-strong);}
.hero__cta .btn--primary:hover,.hero__cta .btn--ghost:hover{background:var(--cm-accent);color:var(--cm-accent-contrast);border-color:var(--cm-accent);}
.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem);align-items:start;}
.split h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.8vw,2.4rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;}
.split p{margin-top:1.1rem;color:var(--cm-gray-300);}
.guides-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-top:2.5rem;}
.who-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1.5rem;margin-top:2.5rem;}
.who-card{background:var(--cm-ink-900);border:1px solid var(--cm-border);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:1.5rem;transition:background var(--dur-3),border-color var(--dur-3);}
.who-card:hover{background:var(--cm-ink-850);border-color:var(--cm-border-strong);}
.who-card h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:var(--w-semibold);}
.who-card p{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);margin-top:0.5rem;}
@media(max-width:820px){.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.guides-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.who-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
</style>
</Fragment>

<main>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
  <div class="page-hero__inner">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1 class="display-lg">We <em>carve</em><br>every <em>model</em><br>with<br>purpose.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Carve Model is a Los Angeles-based physical model studio creating architectural models, sales-gallery models, product prototypes, film miniatures, and art maquettes. We build for moments when ideas must be understood, evaluated, approved, or presented with confidence.</p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact">Get a Preliminary Estimate <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/works">View Our Work <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-hero__visual reveal">
      <span class="corner tl"></span><span class="corner br"></span>
      <img class="hero-photo" src="/assets/about-hero-v5.webp" alt="Carve Model architectural scale model">
      <span class="slot-label">Resort · 1:96 · ABS</span>
      <div class="hero__spec">
        <span class="tick">PROJECTS DELIVERED</span>
        <strong>500+ models</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>


<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3">Built to communicate with purpose.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Every model begins with what it needs to communicate, who needs to understand it, and what decision or experience it must support. These answers guide its scale, content, materials, finishes, and level of detail.</p>
      <p>As digital and AI-generated design becomes increasingly abundant, the need to verify what those ideas mean in physical space becomes more important. Physical models provide tangible evidence that people can examine together, understand in real space, and respond to with greater confidence.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section section--tight"><div class="container">
  <h2 class="display-md">What guides our work</h2>
  <div class="guides-grid">
    <div class="who-card"><h4>Purpose before detail</h4><p>We define the audience, use, and required decisions before determining scale, content, and finish.</p></div>
    <div class="who-card"><h4>A model the room can understand</h4><p>We translate complex design information into physical form that technical and nontechnical audiences can understand together.</p></div>
    <div class="who-card"><h4>A process you can trust</h4><p>Files, milestones, feedback, approvals, and updates are coordinated through a standardized process and the Carve Studio Portal.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section section--tight"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Our studio</span>
  <h2 class="display-md mt-3">Built across borders. Managed as one process.</h2>
  <p class="muted mt-2">Client communication and project coordination are handled by our Los Angeles team, with production completed by our established team in China. Scope, files, approvals, fabrication, quality control, and delivery remain connected through one coordinated Carve process.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Who we work with</span>
  <div class="who-grid">
    <div class="who-card"><h4>Architecture firms, developers and planners</h4></div>
    <div class="who-card"><h4>General contractors and design consultants</h4></div>
    <div class="who-card"><h4>Product designers and hardware teams</h4></div>
    <div class="who-card"><h4>Film, commercial and creative teams</h4></div>
    <div class="who-card"><h4>Artists and cultural institutions</h4></div>
  </div>
</div></section>


<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;"><div class="container">
  <div class="cta reveal" style="position:relative;text-align:center;background:var(--cm-black);border:1px solid var(--cm-border);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem) var(--gutter);">
    <h2 class="display-md">Bring your design into the room.</h2>
    <p class="muted mt-2" style="max-width:46ch;margin-inline:auto;">Tell us what you are creating, who needs to understand it, and what the model needs to help them decide.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:2.4rem;"><a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact">Get a Preliminary Estimate <span class="arrow">→</span></a><a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/works">View Our Work <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
